      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 755,
      "token_end_index": 758
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 113970,
      "end_ms": 114090,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 758,
      "token_end_index": 760
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't think we have a reading week though.",
      "start_ms": 114210,
      "end_ms": 115530,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 760,
      "token_end_index": 776
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't know. We have one class, at least, when we—like.",
